        <mxCell id="p1_note" value="Note: syslog date corrected from Nov 11 to Nov 10 (typo in original). sshd at T03:11 and NRF at T03:57 are 46 min apart, same day. The sshd event (admin login) causally precedes NF provisioning. Cross-source link is operator session context — NOT the same time window. This must be stated explicitly in the paper." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=9;fontColor=#7D4E00;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="286" width="460" height="20" as="geometry"/>
